namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTextInputCustomValidation:ReceiveOnValidateInput {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#DreamTextInputCustomValidation:ReceiveOnValidateInput
    src   "Verify input string, return true if the input string is good to use, false otherwise.\n@param InTextInput   The UITextInputComponent object reference which call this function.\n@param InString      The will display string value, for check if it is valid. If not, then display origin string value.\n@param InIndexOfInsertedChar New inserted char index in InString.\n@return true if the input string is good to use, false otherwise."
    text  "验证输入字符串，如果输入字符串可用则返回 true，否则返回 false。\n@param InTextInput   调用此函数的 UITextInputComponent 组件对象引用。\n@param InString      将要显示的字符串值，用于检查其是否有效。如果无效，则显示原始字符串值。\n@param InIndexOfInsertedChar 新插入字符在 InString 中的索引。\n@return 如果输入字符串可用则返回 true，否则返回 false。"
    state machine
}

