    text  "使用用户实现的 *CustomValidation* 进行自定义输入检查。"
    state machine
}

EUITextInputType.DecimalNumber {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#EUITextInputType:DecimalNumber
    src   "Allows decimal numbers (positive or negative).\nCharacters 0-9, . (dot), and - (dash / minus sign) are allowed. The dash is only allowed as the first character. Only one dot in the string is allowed."
    text  "允许十进制数（正数或负数）。\n允许字符 0-9、.（点）和 -（连字符/减号）。连字符只能作为第一个字符使用。字符串中只允许一个点。"
    state machine
}

EUITextInputType.EmailAddress {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#EUITextInputType:EmailAddress
    src   "Allows the characters that are allowed in an email address.\nAllows characters A-Z, a.z, 0-9, @, . (dot), !, #, $, %, &amp;, ', *, +, -, /, =, ?, ^, _, `, {, |, }, and ~.\nOnly one @ is allowed in the string and more than one dot in a row are not allowed. Note that the character validation does not validate the entire string as being a valid email address since it only does validation on a per-character level, resulting in the typed character either being added to the string or not."
    text  "允许使用电子邮件地址中允许的字符。\n允许字符 A-Z, a.z, 0-9, @, .（点）, !, #, $, %, &amp;, ', *, +, -, /, =, ?, ^, _, `, {, |, }, 和 ~。\n字符串中只允许一个 @，并且不允许出现连续多个点。请注意，字符验证不会将整个字符串验证为有效的电子邮件地址，因为它只在单个字符级别进行验证，结果是输入的字符要么被添加到字符串中，要么不被添加。"
    state machine
}

EUITextInputType.IntegerNumber {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#EUITextInputType:IntegerNumber
    src   "Allow whole numbers (positive or negative).\nCharacters 0-9 and - (dash / minus sign) are allowed. The dash is only allowed as the first character."
    text  "允许整数（正数或负数）。\n允许字符 0-9 和 -（短横线/减号）。短横线只能作为第一个字符。"
    state machine
}

EUITextInputType.Password {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#EUITextInputType:Password
    src   "Display as password, without any validation.\nNOTE!!! This type will be deprecate, use DisplayType.Password instead."
    text  "以密码形式显示，不进行任何验证。\n注意！！！此类型将被弃用，请改用 DisplayType.Password。"
    state machine
}

EUITextInputType.Standard {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#EUITextInputType:Standard
    src   "No validation. Any input is valid."
    text  "不进行验证。任何输入均有效。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bAllowContextMenu {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bAllowContextMenu
    src   "The edit menu -- cut, copy, paste, select all, undo, redo -- reached by right click, by a long\npress on touch, by the gamepad's Menu button, or by Shift+F10, which is Windows' own keyboard\nshortcut for it. UMG's editable text calls this AllowContextMenu and defaults it on.\nOnly the entries that can act right now are built: no Paste with an empty clipboard, no Cut or\nCopy out of a password field."
    text  "编辑菜单——剪切、复制、粘贴、全选、撤销、重做——可通过右键单击、触摸长按、\n手柄的 Menu 按钮或 Shift+F10（Windows 自带的键盘\n快捷键）打开。UMG 的可编辑文本将其称为 AllowContextMenu，并默认开启。\n只会构建当前可以执行的条目：剪贴板为空时没有粘贴，密码字段中不提供剪切或\n复制。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bAllowUndoRedo {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bAllowUndoRedo
    src   "Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y over a snapshot stack of (text, caret). Snapshots are taken before each edit\nthat changes the text, so an undo lands where the edit started rather than at index 0."
    text  "在由（文本、插入符）构成的快照栈上执行 Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y。快照在每次会更改文本的编辑之前拍摄，\n因此撤销会回到编辑开始的位置，而不是索引 0 处。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bAutoActivateInputWhenNavigateIn {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bAutoActivateInputWhenNavigateIn
    src   "Automatic activate input when use navigation input and navigate in this. Tab is the exception that needs\nno switch here: a field Tab lands on starts its edit while UDreamGUISettings::bTabStartsTextEdit."
    text  "使用导航输入并导航到此控件时自动激活输入。Tab 是此处的例外，无需开关：\nTab 所落到的字段会在 UDreamGUISettings::bTabStartsTextEdit 开启时开始编辑。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit
    src   "Stop editing once Enter commits the value -- UMG's ClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit.\n\nTRUE by default, where UMG's is false, because true is what this field has always done: Enter\nsubmitted and immediately ended the edit, with no way to ask for anything else. Turning it off\nis the new answer -- the field keeps the keyboard, ready for the next value, which is what a\nrow of fields a player tabs through wants."
    text  "Enter 提交值后即结束编辑——对应 UMG 的 ClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit。\n\n默认为 TRUE，而 UMG 中默认为 false，因为 true 才是此字段一直以来的做法：Enter\n提交后立即结束编辑，没有任何办法要求别的。将其关闭\n才是新的做法——字段保留键盘，准备好接收下一个值，这正是\n玩家用 Tab 逐个切换的一行字段所需要的。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bIsCaretMovedWhenGainFocus {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bIsCaretMovedWhenGainFocus
    src   "Whether gaining the edit moves the caret -- UMG's IsCaretMovedWhenGainFocus.\n\nOn (the default, and what the field always did), an activation that nobody gave a position for\nputs the caret at the end of the text. Off, the caret stays on the index the previous edit left\nit at, which is what a field being re-entered by code rather than by a player wants.\nA click still places the caret where it landed either way: the click said where."
    text  "获得编辑时是否移动插入符——对应 UMG 的 IsCaretMovedWhenGainFocus。\n\n开启（默认值，也是该字段一直以来的行为）时，没有任何一方指定位置的激活\n会将插入符置于文本末尾。关闭时，插入符会停留在上一次编辑留下的索引处，\n这正是由代码而非玩家重新进入的字段所需要的。\n无论哪种情况，单击仍会将插入符放在点击落下的位置：点击已经指明了位置。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bReadOnly {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bReadOnly
    src   "Read only text block, can copy text content, but not editable."
    text  "只读文本块，可以复制文本内容，但不可编辑。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bRevertTextOnEscape {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bRevertTextOnEscape
    src   "Escape / Back throws the edit away instead of keeping it -- UMG's RevertTextOnEscape.\n\nThe text the field held when the edit STARTED is put back -- a player who opened a name field,\ntyped half a name and changed their mind meant \"undo this\", not \"store what I got to\" -- and the\nrevert is then reported ONCE through the submit/commit events, carrying the restored text, as\nUMG's RestoreOriginalText reports it through OnTextCommitted: whoever stores the value on commit\nstores what the field now holds. An edit that changed nothing reverts nothing and reports\nnothing. The edit ends either way (Escape is Back here). Off by default, which is both UMG's\ndefault and what this field did before the knob existed -- Back ended the edit and the\nhalf-typed value stayed.\n\nOnly the CANCEL road reads it (see CancelInput). Clicking away is not a cancel: nothing was\nsaid about the value, so bSubmitWhenDeactivate still decides what that moment means."
    text  "Escape / Back 会丢弃编辑而不是保留它——对应 UMG 的 RevertTextOnEscape。\n\n编辑开始时字段所持有的文本会被放回——玩家打开名称字段、输入了一半名字又改变主意，\n其意思是“撤销这次操作”，而不是“保存我输入的内容”——随后该还原会通过提交事件\n报告一次，并携带还原后的文本，正如\nUMG 的 RestoreOriginalText 通过 OnTextCommitted 报告的那样：任何在提交时存储值的人，\n存储的是字段当前持有的内容。没有更改任何内容的编辑不会还原任何内容，也不会报告\n任何内容。无论哪种情况编辑都会结束（此处 Escape 即 Back）。默认关闭，这既是 UMG 的\n默认值，也是该开关存在之前此字段的行为——Back 结束编辑，而\n输入了一半的值会保留。\n\n只有 CANCEL 路径会读取它（见 CancelInput）。点击别处不是取消：没有对值\n作出任何表示，因此 bSubmitWhenDeactivate 仍决定那一刻的含义。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bSelectAllTextOnCommit {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bSelectAllTextOnCommit
    src   "Select the whole value after a commit that KEPT the edit going -- UMG's SelectAllTextOnCommit.\nReady to be typed over. Only meaningful while the commit does not also end the edit: selecting\nthe contents of a field nobody is editing shows a highlight with no caret in it."
    text  "在提交后仍继续编辑时选中整个值——即 UMG 的 SelectAllTextOnCommit。\n可直接键入覆盖。仅在提交不会同时结束编辑时才有意义：选中\n无人编辑的字段内容只会显示高亮而其中没有光标。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bSelectAllWhenActivateInput {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bSelectAllWhenActivateInput
    src   "Select all text value when activate input."
    text  "激活输入时选中全部文本值。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bSubmitWhenDeactivate {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bSubmitWhenDeactivate
    src   "Commit the value when the edit ends without an Enter -- clicking away, navigating away, Back /\nEscape ending the edit, the mobile keyboard being dismissed. UMG's editable text has always\nreported that moment through OnTextCommitted; DreamGUI only ever reported Enter, so a field\nthe player filled in and clicked out of never told anyone its value.\nAn Enter that already submitted does not submit twice."
    text  "在编辑未按 Enter 即结束时提交值——点击别处、导航离开、Back /\nEscape 结束编辑、移动端键盘被收起。UMG 的可编辑文本一直\n通过 OnTextCommitted 上报该时刻；DreamGUI 过去只上报 Enter，因此玩家\n填好并点击离开的字段从未告知任何人它的值。\n已经提交过的 Enter 不会再次提交。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:bTabTypesTabCharacter {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:bTabTypesTabCharacter
    src   "Tab types a tab character -- Shift+Tab too, which a keyboard sends as the same character -- and Ctrl+Tab\n(Ctrl+Shift+Tab backwards) is what leaves: what a notes or a code box wants. Multi-line only. Off, the\ndefault and a single-line field's only answer, Tab and Shift+Tab end the edit -- committed as navigating\naway commits (bSubmitWhenDeactivate) -- and move on to the next control or the previous one, as a\nbrowser's fields do; arriving there by Tab starts its edit when UDreamGUISettings::bTabStartsTextEdit."
    text  "Tab 输入制表符——Shift+Tab 也一样，键盘发送的是同一个字符——而 Ctrl+Tab\n（Ctrl+Shift+Tab 反向）才是离开：这是备注或代码框想要的行为。仅限多行。关闭时，\n即默认值，也是单行字段唯一的选择，Tab 和 Shift+Tab 结束编辑——按导航\n离开的方式提交（bSubmitWhenDeactivate）——并移到下一个或上一个控件，如同\n浏览器的字段；通过 Tab 到达时，在 UDreamGUISettings::bTabStartsTextEdit 开启的情况下开始其编辑。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:CancelInput {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:CancelInput
    src   "End the edit the way Escape means it: with bRevertTextOnEscape on, the text the field held when\nthe edit began goes back in and that restored text is submitted once (UMG commits a revert); an\nedit that changed nothing submits nothing. Without it, this is the ordinary end of an edit and\nbSubmitWhenDeactivate still decides whether that moment reports a value.\n\nA road of its own rather than a flag on DeactivateInput, because the two callers mean different\nthings: clicking away said nothing about the value, and Back said \"throw this away\"."
    text  "按 Escape 的语义结束编辑：开启 bRevertTextOnEscape 时，编辑开始时字段持有的文本\n会被放回，并且该恢复后的文本会提交一次（UMG 会提交一次还原）；未做任何\n更改的编辑不提交任何内容。关闭时，这就是编辑的普通结束，\nbSubmitWhenDeactivate 仍决定该时刻是否上报值。\n\n单独一条路径而非 DeactivateInput 上的一个标志，因为两个调用方含义不同：\n点击别处没有对值作出任何表示，而 Back 表示“丢弃它”。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:CaretColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:CaretColor
    src   "Light, because the caret is drawn ON the field and every shipped field is dark: the library's\nFDreamTextInputStyle paints the box (38,42,52) and its text (230,233,240). The old (50,50,50)\nwas four values away from that background -- an invisible caret on the default theme, which is\nthe one state a text field cannot afford. It follows the default text colour instead."
    text  "浅色，因为光标绘制在字段之上，而所有已发布的字段都是深色：库的\nFDreamTextInputStyle 绘制框体 (38,42,52) 及其文本 (230,233,240)。旧的 (50,50,50)\n与该背景只差四个数值——在默认主题下是不可见的光标，而这是\ntext field 唯一无法承受的状态。因此改为跟随默认文本颜色。"
    state machine
}

