UITextInput:CompositionUnderlineColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:CompositionUnderlineColor
    src   "The line drawn under text an IME is still composing, the way every text field marks the\ndifference between \"being typed\" and \"typed\". Slate's editable text does the same thing with\nits EditableText.CompositionBackground brush; a mesh UI has no text-run decoration to hang it\non, so it is drawn the way the selection highlight already is -- a strip per visual run."
    text  "在 IME 仍在组合的文本下方绘制的线，正如每个文本字段都标记出\n“正在输入”与“已输入”的区别。Slate 的可编辑文本用其\nEditableText.CompositionBackground 画刷做同样的事；网格 UI 没有可挂载的\n文本段装饰，因此按现有选区高亮的方式绘制——每个可视文本段一条带。"
    state machine
}

