UITextInput:IgnoreKeys {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:IgnoreKeys
    src   "Keys the field leaves alone while it is edited: they go on to the game and to navigation instead -- the\narrows, say, on a field the pad's arrows should leave. Tab needs no entry: it ends the edit and moves on\nby itself (see bTabTypesTabCharacter), and so does the pad's confirm button."
    text  "字段在编辑时不予处理的按键：它们会转而交给游戏和导航处理——例如手柄方向键本应离开的\n字段上的方向键。Tab 无需列出：它会自行结束编辑并继续移动\n（参见 bTabTypesTabCharacter），手柄的确认键也是如此。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:IsAnyTextSelected {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:IsAnyTextSelected
    src   "Whether anything is selected right now -- UMG's IsAnyTextSelected.\n\nAsked of the two caret indices rather than of the highlight bars: the bars are a VISUAL built\nfrom laid-out geometry and there are none at all before the field has been arranged, while the\nanchor and the caret are the selection itself."
    text  "当前是否有任何内容被选中——对应 UMG 的 IsAnyTextSelected。\n\n查询的是两个光标索引，而不是高亮条：高亮条是由排版几何构建出的 VISUAL，\n在字段完成布局之前根本不存在，\n而锚点和光标才是选区本身。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:IsInputActive {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:IsInputActive
    src   "True while this field owns the keyboard. Back has to know: with a field being edited, cancelling\nthe edit is what the player means, not closing the screen out from under them."
    text  "当此字段拥有键盘输入时为 true。返回操作必须知道：当有字段正在编辑时，\n玩家想要的是取消编辑，而不是在其脚下关闭界面。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:KeyboardType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:KeyboardType
    src   "Which virtual keyboard a mobile platform should summon -- UMG's KeyboardType.\n\nDefault means \"whatever this field's input type implies\", which is what the field has always\nderived on its own (a decimal field asks for the number pad, a password field for the password\nkeyboard). Any other value states the keyboard outright, for the cases the input type cannot\nexpress -- a Standard field that holds an email address, or a web address."
    text  "移动平台应唤起的虚拟键盘——即 UMG 的 KeyboardType。\n\nDefault 表示“由此字段的输入类型决定”，这也是该字段一直\n以来自行推导的结果（小数字段请求数字键盘，密码字段请求密码\n键盘）。其他值则直接指定键盘，用于输入类型无法\n表达的情况——例如存放电子邮件地址或网址的 Standard 字段。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:MaxLength {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:MaxLength
    src   "Largest number of characters the field will hold. 0 means no limit, which is what every field\nwas before this existed. All four write roads answer to it -- typing, pasting, SetText and the\nIME's SetTextInRange -- because a limit only one road honours is not a limit."
    text  "字段可容纳的最大字符数。0 表示不限制，在此属性出现之前每个字段\n都是如此。四种写入途径都受其约束——键入、粘贴、SetText 以及\n输入法的 SetTextInRange——因为只有一条途径遵守的限制算不上限制。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:MultiLineSubmitFunctionKeys {
