    src   "This will be used in multiline mode, when hit enter, if one of these keys is also pressing then the input will submit, otherwise a new line will be added.\nCommonly only use control/shift/alt key.\nNot allow \"Enter\" key."
    text  "此属性用于多行模式：按下回车时，若同时按住其中某个键，则提交输入，否则插入换行。\n通常只使用 control/shift/alt 键。\n不允许使用 \"Enter\" 键。"
    state machine
}

