UITextInput:SetCompositionRange {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:SetCompositionRange
    src   "Mark a run of the text as \"still being composed\" -- drawn with an underline, the way every\ntext field distinguishes an IME's working text from text that has been committed.\n\nSet from the IME context's UpdateCompositionRange (which used to be an empty function body),\nand public because a host driving composition itself -- a mobile keyboard bridge, a test --\nneeds the same road. Indices are offsets into the source string; a zero length clears the mark."
    text  "把一段文本标记为“仍在组合中”——以下划线绘制，就像每个文本字段\n区分 IME 正在处理的文本和已提交文本那样。\n\n由 IME 上下文的 UpdateCompositionRange 设置（它以前是个空函数体），\n之所以公开，是因为自行驱动组合的宿主——移动键盘桥接、测试——\n需要同一条路。索引是源字符串中的偏移；长度为零则清除标记。"
    state machine
}

