UITextInput:SetTabTypesTabCharacter {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:SetTabTypesTabCharacter
    src   "Read at each Tab, so an edit already under way follows the new answer from the next key -- with one exception:\nwith UDreamGUISettings::bTabNavigation off, a field that typed no tabs when its edit began did not bind Tab on\nthe player's controller (GetTextInputKeys, bound once an edit begins), and there only its next edit takes Tab."
    text  "每次 Tab 时读取，因此已在进行中的编辑会从下一个按键起遵循新的设置——但有一个例外：\n当 UDreamGUISettings::bTabNavigation 关闭时，字段在编辑开始时没有输入过 Tab，就不会在\n玩家控制器上绑定 Tab（GetTextInputKeys，在编辑开始时绑定），此时只有下一次编辑才会接受 Tab。"
    state machine
}

