UITextInput:SetTextVisual {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:SetTextVisual
    src   "The text the field edits. EditAnywhere like its neighbours, so the designer and .dui always\nreached it by reflection while no caller could -- the UUIToggle transition-target hole again."
    text  "该字段所编辑的文本。与其相邻属性一样是 EditAnywhere，因此设计器和 .dui 始终\n通过反射访问到它，而任何调用方都访问不到——又是 UUIToggle 过渡目标那个漏洞。"
    state machine
}

