UITextInput:VerifyAndInsertStringAtCaretPosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:VerifyAndInsertStringAtCaretPosition
    src   "Verify input string value and insert the string value to text value at current caret position.\n@param Value string value to check and insert.\n@return true- if any char added."
    text  "验证输入的字符串值，并将该字符串值插入到当前光标位置的文本值中。\n@param Value 要检查和插入的字符串值。\n@return true- 如果添加了任何字符。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:VirtualKeyboardDismissAction {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:VirtualKeyboardDismissAction
    src   "What dismissing the virtual keyboard means -- UMG's VirtualKeyboardDismissAction.\n\nTextCommitOnDismiss keeps what the field did: the keyboard's Done button submits, and so does\ncancelling out of it (through the ordinary end-of-edit road). TextCommitOnAccept submits only\non Done. TextChangeOnDismiss never submits from the keyboard at all -- the text changed, and\nthat is the whole of what happened."
    text  "关闭虚拟键盘意味着什么——UMG 的 VirtualKeyboardDismissAction。\n\nTextCommitOnDismiss 保持该字段原有的行为：键盘的“完成”按钮会提交，\n取消虚拟键盘也一样（走普通的编辑结束路径）。TextCommitOnAccept 仅在\n“完成”时提交。TextChangeOnDismiss 从不在键盘上提交——文本已更改，\n这就是所发生的全部。"
    state machine
}

UITextInput:VirtualKeyboardTrigger {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UITextInput.h#UITextInput:VirtualKeyboardTrigger
    src   "Which activations summon the virtual keyboard -- UMG's VirtualKeyboardTrigger.\n\nOnAllFocusEvents by default, where UMG's default is OnFocusByPointer, because every activation\nused to raise it: a field navigated into with a pad still needs a keyboard, since a pad has no\nother way to type. OnFocusByPointer is the opt-in for a screen that drives its own."
    text  "哪些激活会唤起虚拟键盘——UMG 的 VirtualKeyboardTrigger。\n\n默认是 OnAllFocusEvents，而 UMG 的默认值是 OnFocusByPointer，因为过去每次激活\n都会唤起它：用手柄导航进入的字段仍然需要键盘，因为手柄没有别的输入方式。\nOnFocusByPointer 是为自行驱动键盘的界面提供的可选项。"
    state machine
}
